<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn cattle market not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn cattle market not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not tested, compared with Monday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>On a carcass basis, steers and heifers not well tested.</p>
<p>Steers:  Select and Choice 2-4 1250-1300 lbs 2ld 112.00.</p>
<p>Reported sales for Tues: 100. Week to Date: 5,800</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
